{
"recipe_id":"13 Basic Cake Baking 1",
"source_text":"Cake baking -Recipe 1\n\n用料\n土鸡蛋 6只\n玉米油 40克\n牛奶 150毫升\n低筋面粉 100克\n玉米淀粉 30克\n细砂糖 80克\n柠檬汁 / 白醋 几滴\n\n做法\n准备两个碗，装蛋清的碗需无水无油。\n6个冷藏一夜的土鸡蛋，分离蛋清和蛋黄。\n蛋清放入冷冻室 15 分钟。\n将牛奶和玉米油称量好，用打蛋器搅打至乳化。\n加入玉米淀粉和低筋面粉（不用过筛）。\n将蛋黄加入面糊中，搅拌均匀。\n如果觉得面糊有腥味或油味，可以加入两滴香草精。\n将面糊过筛一遍，放入冰箱冷藏。这一步很重要，不可省略。\n冷冻 15 分钟后的蛋清会出现冰渣，此时开始打发蛋清。蛋清中加入 3 滴柠檬汁，全程高速打发。\n第一次打发：蛋清呈大泡状时，加入第一次糖。\n第二次打发：蛋清呈白色流动状时，加入第二次糖。\n打好的蛋清提起后有小尖角，倒扣不掉落。\n烤盘放入烤箱；烤箱 180 度预热 10 分钟。\n从冰箱取出蛋黄糊。\n将蛋清分两次次加入蛋黄糊中。\n在两个 9 寸模具中铺上油纸。\n将蛋糕糊倒入模具中，大约 8 分满。\n放入烤箱，设置 130 度烤 60 分钟。\n烤至 50 分钟时，蛋糕会微微膨胀。\n烤好出炉，不坍塌、不回缩。",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "6个冷藏一夜的土鸡蛋，分离蛋清和蛋黄。", "text_en": "Separate the six eggs, which have been refrigerated overnight, into egg whites and yolks.", "start_char": 111, "end_char": 130, "node_indices": [1, 2, 3], "edge_indices": [1, 2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 2, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "蛋清放入冷冻室 15 分钟。", "text_en": "Put the egg whites in the freezer for 15 minutes.", "start_char": 131, "end_char": 145, "node_indices": [2, 4], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 3, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "将牛奶和玉米油称量好", "text_en": "Measure out the milk.", "start_char": 146, "end_char": 156, "node_indices": [5, 6], "edge_indices": [4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 4, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "将牛奶和玉米油称量好", "text_en": "Measure out the corn oil.", "start_char": 146, "end_char": 156, "node_indices": [7, 8], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 5, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 5, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "用打蛋器搅打至乳化。", "text_en": "Whisk the milk and corn oil with a whisk until emulsified.", "start_char": 157, "end_char": 167, "node_indices": [6, 8, 9], "edge_indices": [6, 7], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 6, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 7, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 7, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "加入玉米淀粉", "text_en": "Add the cornstarch.", "start_char": 168, "end_char": 174, "node_indices": [9, 10], "edge_indices": [8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 8, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 8, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "和低筋面粉（不用过筛）。", "text_en": "Add the low-gluten flour without sifting it.", "start_char": 174, "end_char": 186, "node_indices": [9, 11], "edge_indices": [9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 9, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 9, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "将蛋黄加入面糊中，", "text_en": "Add the yolks to the batter.", "start_char": 187, "end_char": 196, "node_indices": [3, 9], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 10, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 10, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "搅拌均匀。", "text_en": "Stir until evenly combined.", "start_char": 196, "end_char": 201, "node_indices": [9, 12], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 11, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 11, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "如果觉得面糊有腥味或油味，可以加入两滴香草精。", "text_en": "If the batter smells eggy or oily, add two drops of vanilla extract.", "start_char": 202, "end_char": 225, "node_indices": [12, 13], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 12, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 12, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "将面糊过筛一遍，", "text_en": "Sift the batter once.", "start_char": 226, "end_char": 234, "node_indices": [12, 14], "edge_indices": [13], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 13, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 13, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "放入冰箱冷藏。", "text_en": "Refrigerate the batter.", "start_char": 234, "end_char": 241, "node_indices": [14, 15], "edge_indices": [14], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 14, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 14, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "此时开始打发蛋清。", "text_en": "At this point, begin whisking the egg whites.", "start_char": 272, "end_char": 281, "node_indices": [4, 16], "edge_indices": [15], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 15, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 15, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "蛋清中加入 3 滴柠檬汁，", "text_en": "Add three drops of lemon juice to the egg whites.", "start_char": 281, "end_char": 294, "node_indices": [16, 17], "edge_indices": [16], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 16, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 16, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S015", "text": "全程高速打发。", "text_en": "Whisk at high speed throughout.", "start_char": 294, "end_char": 301, "node_indices": [16, 18], "edge_indices": [17], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 17, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 17, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S016", "text": "第一次打发：蛋清呈大泡状时，", "text_en": "For the first whisking stage, whisk until the egg whites form large bubbles.", "start_char": 302, "end_char": 316, "node_indices": [18, 19], "edge_indices": [18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 18, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 18, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S017", "text": "加入第一次糖。", "text_en": "Add the first portion of sugar.", "start_char": 316, "end_char": 323, "node_indices": [19, 20], "edge_indices": [19], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 19, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 19, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S018", "text": "第二次打发：蛋清呈白色流动状时，", "text_en": "For the second whisking stage, whisk until the egg whites are white and flowing.", "start_char": 324, "end_char": 340, "node_indices": [19, 21], "edge_indices": [20], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 20, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 20, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S019", "text": "加入第二次糖。", "text_en": "Add the second portion of sugar.", "start_char": 340, "end_char": 346, "node_indices": [21, 22], "edge_indices": [21], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 22, "edge_index": 21, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 21, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S020", "text": "打好的蛋清提起后有小尖角，倒扣不掉落。", "text_en": "Finish whisking the egg whites until they form small peaks when lifted and do not fall out when inverted.", "start_char": 347, "end_char": 366, "node_indices": [21, 23], "edge_indices": [22], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 22, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 23, "edge_index": 22, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S021", "text": "烤箱 180 度预热 10 分钟。", "text_en": "Preheat the oven to 180°C for 10 minutes.", "start_char": 374, "end_char": 390, "node_indices": [24, 25], "edge_indices": [23], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 23, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 25, "edge_index": 23, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S022", "text": "将蛋清分两次次加入蛋黄糊中。", "text_en": "Divide the whipped egg whites into two portions for adding to the yolk batter.", "start_char": 401, "end_char": 416, "node_indices": [23, 26, 27], "edge_indices": [24, 25], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 23, "edge_index": 24, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 26, "edge_index": 24, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 23, "edge_index": 25, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 27, "edge_index": 25, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S023", "text": "将蛋清分两次次加入蛋黄糊中。", "text_en": "Add the first portion of egg whites to the yolk batter.", "start_char": 401, "end_char": 416, "node_indices": [15, 26], "edge_indices": [26], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 26, "edge_index": 26, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 26, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S024", "text": "将蛋清分两次次加入蛋黄糊中。", "text_en": "Add the second portion of egg whites to the yolk batter.", "start_char": 401, "end_char": 416, "node_indices": [15, 27], "edge_indices": [27], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 27, "edge_index": 27, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 27, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S025", "text": "将蛋清分两次次加入蛋黄糊中。", "text_en": "Incorporate the egg whites into the yolk batter to make cake batter.", "start_char": 401, "end_char": 416, "node_indices": [15, 28], "edge_indices": [28], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 28, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 28, "edge_index": 28, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S026", "text": "放入烤箱，", "text_en": "Put the cake batter into the oven.", "start_char": 452, "end_char": 457, "node_indices": [25, 28], "edge_indices": [29], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 28, "edge_index": 29, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 25, "edge_index": 29, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S027", "text": "设置 130 度烤 60 分钟。", "text_en": "Set the oven to 130°C and bake for 60 minutes.", "start_char": 457, "end_char": 474, "node_indices": [25, 29], "edge_indices": [30], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 25, "edge_index": 30, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 29, "edge_index": 30, "role": "output"}]}],
